    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ve'han now claims the Nordrassil Lodge, under the boughs of the great tree, as his lair. It is time for us to put this magic to the ultimate test.\r\n\r\nTake the staff and bring it to bear against Ve'han. Dispel the magic protecting him and bring him to justice!",
